Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.80,Title,0,0,0,0,,《无敌浩克》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.40,0:01:19.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（危险）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.00,0:02:03.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（爆炸撼动校园）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:05.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（卡尔弗大学发生神秘事件）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.60,0:02:07.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（有人目击绿色怪物）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.80,0:02:15.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发现实验室设备）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.90,0:02:17.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（嫌犯逃逸）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:27.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（有人目击绿色大脚怪）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.80,0:02:34.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（武器征用要求：核准 史氏工业）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:42.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（班纳试图联络罗丝博士）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.60,0:02:45.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（追捕行动继续）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:47.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（毒眼 神盾局长）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:50.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（关系人：罗斯博士）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.90,0:02:54.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（他不再逃亡了吗？）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.10,0:02:55.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（五个月没有出现）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:15.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（距离上次变身 第158天）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:25.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴西 荷欣尼亚贫民区）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,熟了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:10.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（葡英字典）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.60,0:04:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪的老爹先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie's dad, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,打得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! That's a great punch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿肚子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.10,0:05:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要练习控制呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's work on your breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是掌控情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.00,0:05:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧是不好的 所以要控制情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear no good. So emotion and control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用你的横膈膜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your diaphragm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.00,0:05:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要控制你的怒气\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best way to control your anger…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.20,0:05:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要控制你的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to control your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制你的脉搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control your pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是暂时修好 你需要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make it work for a while, but you need…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一间新工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a new factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.20,0:07:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这五个月来你一直在帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five months you've been helping me out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太聪明 不该当临时工\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too smart for day labor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我正式雇用你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me put you on payroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.10,0:07:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉！快关掉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut that off! Turn it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.90,0:08:43.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（出口国 美国）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.50,0:09:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想跟我吃午饭吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to have lunch with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开 臭老外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get lost, Gringo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.40,0:09:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想找麻烦吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让我…饿肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me… hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.60,0:09:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会喜欢我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't like me when I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.50,0:09:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用错字了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没？看到吗？我可以离开这鬼地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that? See that? My ticket out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:31.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加密中）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:34.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蓝先生 你在吗？）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.00,0:10:38.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（绿先生 很高兴你打来）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.30,0:10:40.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我神秘的朋友 真高兴又跟你连络上！）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.20,0:10:43.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我找到了）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:45.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（终于！）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:47.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（那种花很美吧？）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.50,0:10:54.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（务必要注射高剂量 祝好运）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:56.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（又一次失败）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:11:59.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你用了多少？）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.60,0:12:05.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（全部）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:08.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我们该见面了）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:13.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不安全）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:16.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伽玛辐射感染很危险）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.80,0:12:17.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（别再找花了）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:19.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（寄血液样本给我）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.50,0:12:24.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（要不然我就帮不了你）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:36.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（绿先生）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.10,0:12:40.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蓝先生 纽约市）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:55.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（维吉尼亚州 阿灵顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个你也许有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's something a bit more interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怀疑是伽玛中毒 密尔瓦基市\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a possible gamma sickness. Milwaukee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.00,0:13:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人喝了一瓶瓜拿纳果汽水\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man drank one of those guarana sodas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果比他想像的更带劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess it had a little more kick than he was looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.10,0:13:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 汽水在哪里装瓶？- 波尔图港 巴西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where was it bottled? - Porto Verde, Brazil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,派人到装瓶工厂找一个白人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have our people look for a white man at the bottling plant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.10,0:13:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,先按兵不动 要是被他看到他就会逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them no contact! If he even sees them, he's gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:32.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（强生堡 佛州沼泽地）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.80,0:13:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替你找到最顶尖的士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you who I could. Short notice, but they're all quality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.30,0:13:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中有一个王牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I pulled you one ace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.80,0:14:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊密布朗斯基 俄国出生 英国长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emil Blonsky. Born in Russia, raised in England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.60,0:14:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,从皇家陆战队借调到特种部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on loan to SOCOM from the Royal Marines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.90,0:14:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你动用了些人脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you cashed in some chips for this, Joe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.40,0:14:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意帮忙 祝你任务成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad I could help. Just make it good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是目标和位置 这是逮捕行动 生擒活捉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the target and the location. Snatch and grab, live capture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要用麻醉枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have your dart clips and suppression ordnance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,非不得已才能开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}but live fire is for backup only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方会协助 但不能打草惊蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got local out there, but we want it tight and quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会反抗吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he a fighter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标是躲避美国政府的逃犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your target is a fugitive from the US government{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他窃取军事机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}who stole military secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也涉嫌杀害两名科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is also implicated in the deaths of two scientists, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.90,0:14:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名军官一名爱达荷州州警 以及两名加拿大猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a military officer, an Idaho state trooper and possibly two Canadian hunters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.80,0:14:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以别等他反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't wait to see if he's a fighter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他麻醉然后带他回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tranq him and bring him back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:21.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（好消息）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:24.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（初步验血显示伽玛量明显减少）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:33.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（可以治好我吗？）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.60,0:15:35.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（可以）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:42.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不过我需要更多资料）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.30,0:15:46.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（细胞感染程度 伽玛浓度）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.40,0:15:52.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不可能 资料不在这里）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.30,0:15:54.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（在哪里？）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.70,0:16:07.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（家里）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.10,0:16:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,针孔摄影机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那只狗赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get rid of the damn dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.90,0:17:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标在逃逸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target's on the move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.30,0:17:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,地面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上吧！- 上吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go! - Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.70,0:17:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:17:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快…快…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.30,0:18:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把人群赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear everyone out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.70,0:18:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别追丢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not lose him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.20,0:19:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧跟在他后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get around behind him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.40,0:20:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标经过090机动车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target moving past mobile unit 0-9-0.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.70,0:20:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.80,0:21:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在哪里？- 看到目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he? - Target acquired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭老外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gringo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起滚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.20,0:22:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the computer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.80,0:22:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimme that! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,耍不了狠了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so tough now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.30,0:22:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来功夫那套呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try those fancy moves again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.50,0:22:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.30,0:22:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.70,0:22:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我…生气…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me… angry…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.20,0:22:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,会很坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.70,0:22:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生气会很坏？我生气才会很坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bad angry, G? I very bad angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.80,0:22:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.10,0:22:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就会发生很糟的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand! Something really bad is about to happen here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.90,0:22:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你会遭殃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah… very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.80,0:23:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody else seeing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.90,0:23:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个不明物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a bogey of some kind. Please advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.90,0:23:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是目标 使用麻醉枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the target! Use every tranq you've got!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.10,0:23:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.10,0:23:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,用真枪！用真枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go live! Go live! Go live!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.70,0:24:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 - 离开这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move!- Get out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.00,0:24:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.80,0:24:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在后面 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's behind us! Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.90,0:24:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.80,0:24:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.80,0:25:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,离…我…远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.20,0:26:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.80,0:26:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪前我就知道事情不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew something was different before I got the shot off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.50,0:26:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他逃走时留下这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had it on him when he bolted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.00,0:26:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他女友？她在帮他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a girlfriend? She helps him, maybe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.40,0:26:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不再是个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is no longer a factor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.30,0:26:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们早就失联 他是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We closed that door to him a long time ago. He's alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.90,0:27:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也想要离群索居 不过查查看他有和谁联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to be alone. But see if he's been talking to anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.70,0:27:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我冒昧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.50,0:27:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人想谈谈刚才的事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't anybody want to talk about what went down in there? 'Cause…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.30,0:27:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他甩掉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't lose us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.70,0:27:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he was not alone, sir. We had him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.60,0:27:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把他困住了 只是后来被攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then something hit us, something…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.10,0:27:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个很大的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something big hit us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.90,0:27:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它把堆高机当作垒球丢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It threw a forklift truck like it was a softball!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.20,0:27:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是我见过力量最强大的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the most powerful thing I've ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.70,0:27:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.70,0:27:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是班纳知道那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if Banner knows what it is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.40,0:27:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会逮到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna track him down, I'm gonna put my foot on his throat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.70,0:27:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 逼他说出… - 那就是班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and I'm gonna… - That was Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.30,0:27:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.10,0:27:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}was Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.80,0:28:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你必须解释清楚 长官 - 我不必解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have to explain that statement, sir. - No, I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.30,0:28:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你表现得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done a good job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.50,0:28:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾好就带队上飞机 我们要回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack up and get our men on a plane. We're going home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.40,0:29:05.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（距离上次变身 第1天）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.10,0:29:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.90,0:29:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.10,0:29:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.70,0:29:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会说葡萄牙话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't speak Portuguese.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.40,0:29:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.10,0:29:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where an I?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.50,0:29:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓜地马拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guatemala.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.80,0:29:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去下一个城镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to the next town.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.60,0:29:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.70,0:29:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.10,0:29:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 披着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, put this on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.90,0:29:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.50,0:30:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.40,0:30:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前出任务也出过差错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've run into bad situations on crap missions before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.60,0:30:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,同袍因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen good men go down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.70,0:30:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,事先不知情白白牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}purely because someone didn't let us know what we were walking into.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.20,0:30:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是军人 必须继续战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've moved on to the next one, because that's what we do, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.60,0:30:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的天职\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.00,0:30:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这玩意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.20,0:30:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事太诡异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a whole new level of weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.00,0:30:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能就这样撒手不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't feel inclined to step away from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.90,0:30:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要再去抓他 我要参一脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you're taking another crack at him, I want in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.10,0:30:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次一定要事先准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, with respect, you should be looking for a team that's prepped and ready to fight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.00,0:30:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为要是那玩意再出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}because if that thing shows up again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.20,0:30:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,最勇敢的军人也会被吓得尿裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna have a lot of professional tough guys pissing in their pants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.80,0:30:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.50,0:30:52.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（墨西哥 恰帕斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.10,0:31:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有更宽的裤子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tienes mas stretchy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.60,0:31:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Perfecto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.20,0:32:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉你的事非常敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me emphasise that what I'm about to share with you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.60,0:32:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我和对军方都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}is tremendously sensitive, both to me personally and the Army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.80,0:32:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该知道美国的武器研发计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're aware that we've got an Infantry Weapons Development programme.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.00,0:32:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,二次大战期间 他们进行新实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in WWII, they initiated a subprogram{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.80,0:32:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物科技力量增强实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Bio- Tech Force Enhancement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.40,0:32:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,打造超级大兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Super Soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.70,0:32:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.60,0:32:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没这么简单 但是没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}An oversimplification, but yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.70,0:32:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令他们再度进行大胆实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I dusted it off, got 'em doing serious work again, bold work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.70,0:32:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,研发部只想制造更好的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Across the hall, they were trying to arm you better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.50,0:32:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们则想打造更强的士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were tryin' to make you better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.10,0:32:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳的实验只达到初步阶段 根本就还不能应用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner's work was very early phase. It wasn't even weapons application.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.60,0:32:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以为他在研究抗辐射方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought he was working on radiation resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.20,0:33:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没告诉他真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never have told him what the project really was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.50,0:33:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他太有把握了 竟然私自进行人体实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was so sure of what he was onto, that he tested it on himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.20,0:33:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果出了大错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And something went very wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.50,0:33:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是完全做对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it went very right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.20,0:33:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的身体是属于美国军方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I'm concerned, that man's whole body is the property of the US Army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.30,0:33:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他不是研发武器 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said he wasn't working on weapons, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.40,0:33:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 但你是 是你 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - But you were. You were, weren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.60,0:33:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你们在进行别的实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were trying other things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.70,0:33:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们研发出一种\N{\fnArial\fs30}One serum we developed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.80,0:33:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有潜力的血清\N{\fnArial\fs30}was very promising.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.30,0:33:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他为什么要逃亡？- 他是个科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So why did he run? - He's a scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.30,0:33:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是军人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.40,0:33:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你几岁？45岁？- 39岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Blonsky, how old are you? 45? - 39.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.30,0:33:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打仗老得快 对吧？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It takes a toll, doesn't it? - Yes, it does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.90,0:33:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别再出任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}So get out of the trenches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.30,0:33:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,以你的记录 你可以当上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be a Colonel by now, with your record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.90,0:33:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是战士 永远都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm a fighter. I'll be one for as long as I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.20,0:34:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果十年前的我有我现在的经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if I could take what I know now, put it in the body I had ten years ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.50,0:34:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对不会跟我自己对决\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would be someone I wouldn't want to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.10,0:34:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以让你变得更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could probably arrange something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.20,0:34:16.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（维吉尼亚州 卡尔弗大学）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.00,0:34:29.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（距离上次变身 第17天）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.40,0:35:12.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（生物科学系大楼）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.20,0:35:19.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伊莉莎白罗斯博士 细胞生物学）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.70,0:36:28.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（史丹利比萨餐馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.30,0:36:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care, kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.60,0:36:34.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（打烊）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.40,0:36:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,史丹 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stan, I give you my word, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.90,0:36:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关我的谣言都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever you've heard about me, it's not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.60,0:36:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我一直都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know it. I always knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.90,0:36:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道我跟你们俩的交情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you know how I felt about you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.60,0:36:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去找过她吗？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you talked to her? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.60,0:37:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不知道我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't know that I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.60,0:37:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她有男友了？- 对 他是精神科医师\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's with somebody? - Yeah, he's a head shrink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.10,0:37:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说是最顶尖的 好人一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say he's one of the best. But a really nice guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.60,0:37:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 那很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.50,0:37:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布鲁斯 我能帮你什么忙？- 我需要地方住几晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bruce, what can I do to help you? - I could use a bed for a few nights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.40,0:37:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以用楼上的空房间 - 那真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can have the spare room upstairs. - That'd be so great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.10,0:37:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有另一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one other thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.40,0:37:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Pardon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.80,0:37:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.90,0:37:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 我要送比萨到五楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, pal. I got a delivery on five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.80,0:37:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,五楼没人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think there's anybody up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.30,0:37:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,收不到钱我就惨了 拜托让我上去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. I'm gonna catch hell if I don't collect. You got to let me try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.70,0:37:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我多了一块比萨 我请客\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what. I got an extra medium. Take it on the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.20,0:38:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你很上道 - 老天保佑你 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are the man. - God bless you, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.90,0:38:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.30,0:38:55.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（用户名： 罗斯博士）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.40,0:39:06.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（密码： *****）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.80,0:39:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.90,0:39:17.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（计划名称：伽玛脉冲 搜寻中…）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.70,0:39:20.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（查无此资料）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.50,0:39:25.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（搜寻参数：B.班纳）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.70,0:39:29.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（查无此资料）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.30,0:39:38.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加密网络）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.40,0:39:40.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（登入 远端聊天）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.90,0:39:46.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（呼叫蓝先生）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.80,0:39:51.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（绿先生 找到资料了吗？）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.50,0:39:54.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（资料不见了）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.30,0:39:56.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（没有资料…）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.60,0:39:57.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我帮不上忙）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.60,0:40:03.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（现在怎么办？）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.70,0:40:08.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我必须继续逃亡）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.40,0:40:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打烊了 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're pretty well closed here, folks. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.80,0:40:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 史丹 周五夜耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, Stan. It's Friday night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.40,0:40:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,先说好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.60,0:40:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了意大利干酱什么都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing but marinara now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.90,0:40:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要吃块比萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I got to have a Mister Pink, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.00,0:40:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她忙着工作 又没吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}She worked through dinner again, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.00,0:40:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,史丹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.50,0:40:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he… I go, "So, yeah, I mean, where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.00,0:40:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30})I can't… I don't know where you were, Cecil."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.00,0:40:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 我没在你那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he goes, "Not where you been at."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.60,0:41:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 噢 上帝啊 感觉真是太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought, "Oh, my God." I just felt so awful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.90,0:41:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.90,0:41:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂？怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betty? What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.30,0:41:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betty…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.50,0:41:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到的是不是真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me if I saw what I think I saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.90,0:42:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道该说什么 - 拜托你说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know what to say. - Please, just tell me the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.00,0:42:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走 别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go. Don't go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.50,0:42:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to come with me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.50,0:43:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.20,0:43:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.50,0:43:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our data.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.00,0:43:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我趁他们把一切搬走前拿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got in there before they carted it all away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.20,0:43:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望有一天能找到解答\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hoped somewhere that it might tell us something someday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.30,0:43:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 将军知道这件事吗？- 应该不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does the General know that you have this? - No, I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.00,0:43:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有两年没跟他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't spoken to him in a couple of years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.50,0:43:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to be sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.10,0:44:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不能一起直接去找他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce, I don't understand why we can't just go in there together and talk to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.10,0:44:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟我说过他想做什么 他要取出我体内的细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me what he wanted to do. He wants it out of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.20,0:44:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行分析后再复制它\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to dissect it so that he can replicate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.60,0:44:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它成为武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to make it a weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.10,0:44:36.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（冷冻计划：增强武器）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.10,0:45:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我猜你会想要… - 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you might want to… - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.90,0:45:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最好早点走 愈早愈好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I should leave early, as early as I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.50,0:45:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？你不能待下来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? You can't stay at all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.10,0:45:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想 但是这里不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to, but it's just not safe for me to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.00,0:45:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能借点钱吗？- 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If I could borrow some cash… - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.80,0:45:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得搭巴士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to take a bus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.50,0:45:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少让我陪你去车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least let me walk you to the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.20,0:45:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.20,0:45:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该有的都有了吗？- 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have everything you need? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.80,0:45:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.30,0:45:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.80,0:45:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 - 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good night. - Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.90,0:45:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量休息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you get some rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.00,0:46:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会替你注射最低剂量\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're giving you a very low dose only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.10,0:46:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你保持专注听命行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you sharp out there and disciplined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.80,0:46:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要出现副作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}First sign of any side effect, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.90,0:46:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喊停 等你恢复以后才能复职\N{\fnArial\fs30}we stop and you're off team until you straighten out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.30,0:46:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 同意吗？- 同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Agreed? - Agreed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.00,0:46:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要打两次针\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get two separate infusions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.80,0:47:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一针打入深肌 一针打入骨髓\N{\fnArial\fs30}One into the deep muscle, one into the bone marrow centres.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.20,0:47:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二针会很痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bone ones are going to hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.00,0:47:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.80,0:47:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.60,0:48:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.60,0:48:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我帮你拉出来 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just wanna do this. - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.80,0:48:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样比较好看 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's better like that. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.60,0:48:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,帽子太小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels too tight, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.20,0:48:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是有点小 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, a little. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.50,0:48:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - They're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.80,0:48:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝蒂 看着我 看着我 - 布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Betty, look at me, look at me! - Bruce!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.30,0:48:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离我远点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to go far away from me as you can!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.70,0:48:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别和我争了 走就是了 快走！- 布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't argue with me, just go. Go! - Bruce!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.30,0:48:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,3分钟后狙击手就会到位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! We'd have had snipers on target in three more minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.50,0:48:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁擅自行动？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know who jumped the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.40,0:48:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他逃向270方位\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's heading 2- 7- 0.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.70,0:49:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,布朗斯基 还不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blonsky! Not yet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.80,0:49:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.60,0:49:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意看 这会很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look alive. This could get interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.30,0:50:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.60,0:50:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车！停车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.50,0:50:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're in there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.80,0:50:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.90,0:50:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.50,0:50:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.10,0:50:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸 求求你住手 - 你不清楚状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad, please don't do this. - You can't see this clearly. Now, get inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.30,0:50:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.20,0:50:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标在天桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target is in the overpass. We have a visual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.50,0:50:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not engage! Repeat, do not engage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.40,0:50:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被锁在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's locked in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.00,0:50:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射两枚催泪弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put two canisters in there with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.10,0:50:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.30,0:51:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her back here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.00,0:51:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会看清真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.90,0:52:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,A队？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.10,0:52:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,全力开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him have all of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.40,0:52:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 干掉他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, light him up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.20,0:52:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,50口径火炮呢？快上呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the fifty cals? Move your asses!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.60,0:53:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.50,0:53:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,布朗斯基 上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blonsky, now you're up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.20,0:53:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.50,0:53:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.90,0:53:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.40,0:54:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 他真的变强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, he's doing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.80,0:54:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他引到音波炮那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move him toward the cannons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.30,0:54:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.90,0:54:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,守好你的位置！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your position!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.20,0:54:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.40,0:55:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, please, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.10,0:55:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你 - 让她回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, please, please!- Get her back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.60,0:55:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're killing him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.60,0:55:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！放开我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Get off of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.10,0:55:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.60,0:55:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce! Bruce!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.90,0:55:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击直升机呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the gunship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.10,0:56:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.40,0:56:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,布朗斯基 撤退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blonsky, pull back now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.30,0:56:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.70,0:56:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就只有这点料吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.10,0:56:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 撤退！- 撤退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fall back! - Fall back! Let's go, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.70,0:56:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快找掩护！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.10,0:56:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.80,0:56:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开火呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire, goddamn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.10,0:57:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.50,0:57:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,停火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop firing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.20,0:57:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.80,0:58:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打给我是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did the right thing, calling us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.50,0:58:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道他们去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know where they're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.50,0:58:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟他在一起很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be in incredible danger as long as she's with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.70,0:58:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会伤害她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}From who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.90,0:58:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他保护她 你却差点害死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He protected her. You almost killed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.60,0:58:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 她的安危最重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you my word, her safety is my main concern at this point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.40,0:58:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为精神科医师的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's a point of professional pride with me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.20,0:58:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看得出谁说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I can always tell when somebody's lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.50,0:58:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.90,0:58:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where he's going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.10,0:58:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只知道她一定会帮他 - 那她就算是协助逃犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know she'll help him, if she can. - Then she's aiding a fugitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.50,0:58:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也帮不了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't help either one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.10,0:59:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想她为什么从不提起你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to wonder why she never talked about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.60,0:59:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我知道原因了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.90,0:59:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她都在哪里率墩庑┭方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does she meet these guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.70,1:00:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.10,1:00:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.50,1:00:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 没有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.80,1:00:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Come this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.70,1:01:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.40,1:01:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.50,1:01:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.70,1:01:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是下雨而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.70,1:01:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能再走路吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will he ever walk again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.00,1:01:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他全身的骨头支离破碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the bones in his body look like crushed gravel right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.60,1:01:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我很佩服他 他的心脏像个机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will say this for him. He's got a heart like a machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.50,1:02:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟赛马一样强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen anything like it, outside of a racehorse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.30,1:03:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.80,1:03:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.30,1:03:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.10,1:03:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.40,1:03:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我感觉好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, actually, I feel a lot better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.80,1:04:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就好 - 我得把资料拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. - I just had to get my data back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.90,1:04:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把它吃掉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ate it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.10,1:04:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况紧急 我总得想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, the circumstances called for a little improvisation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.00,1:04:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,款式不多 不过你有一些选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so they didn't have a great selection, but I got you some options.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.40,1:04:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意比较重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}First thing's first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.10,1:04:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.00,1:04:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.70,1:04:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 这是最宽松的一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - They were the stretchiest pair they had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.60,1:04:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take my chances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.20,1:04:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关于军队和不明敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumours continue to swirl about a violent clash{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.80,1:04:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在卡尔弗大学校园发生激烈战斗的谣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}between forces of the US military and an unknown adversary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.60,1:04:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,持续延烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the campus of Culver University earlier today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.70,1:04:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,两名大二学生目击整个事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophomores Jack McGhee and Jim Wilson witnessed some of the battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.00,1:04:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意超大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was so big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.60,1:04:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像一个绿色巨人 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was like this huge, like, hulk! - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.50,1:04:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一名学生是校报记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}McGhee, who happens to be a reporter for the campus paper, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.60,1:04:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用手机拍下这些画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}captured this on his cell phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.40,1:05:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,国家森林下起一阵雷暴雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Further search for the mysterious "hulk"…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.20,1:05:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,神秘绿巨人的搜寻行动因此拖延\N{\fnArial\fs30}was postponed by powerful thunderstorms in the Smoky Mountain National Forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.30,1:05:08.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（汽车旅馆）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.20,1:05:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面不要剪太短\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not too short back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.30,1:05:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前帮你剪过头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have done this before, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.60,1:05:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你自己是怎么剪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how you've done this on your own for all this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.30,1:05:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常都是用电剪\N{\fnArial\fs30}With clippers, usually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.10,1:06:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 等一下 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, wait, wait. Wait. - What? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.90,1:06:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.30,1:06:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没关系 我想要 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. I want to. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.50,1:06:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.70,1:06:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.50,1:06:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能太兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get too excited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.20,1:06:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点点都不行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even a little excited?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.00,1:06:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.00,1:07:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 是布朗斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, it's Blonsky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.40,1:07:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有没有家人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone found out if he has next of kin or family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.10,1:07:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask him yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.60,1:07:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.80,1:07:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴看到你复原 大兵 - 谢谢你 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good to see you back on your feet, soldier. - Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.80,1:07:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.00,1:07:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,超不爽的 我要打第三回合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pissed off and ready for round three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.90,1:08:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都不能用 会被追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, we can't use any of this, because they can track all of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.00,1:08:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的唇蜜都会被追踪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my lip gloss? Can they track that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.70,1:08:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会 你可以拿去 - 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. You can take your lip gloss. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.90,1:08:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也需要眼镜 - 你也可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I need my glasses. - Well, you can take{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.90,1:08:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把眼镜和手表拿去 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- your glasses and your watch, okay? - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.20,1:08:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部份都能用 不能用信用卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can use most of it. We just can't use the credit cards, the ID or the phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.90,1:08:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 手机也别开机 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't even turn that on. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.30,1:08:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能用现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll take the cash, obviously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.50,1:08:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,光靠四十块钱该怎么逃亡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will we get where we need to go on $40 and no credit cards?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.50,1:08:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以典当这条项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we could sell this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.40,1:08:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是你妈唯一留给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, that's the only thing you have left from her. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.20,1:08:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就一定要赎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we'll have to try and get it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.60,1:08:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查局在监视手机信用卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Federal is already monitoring phones, plastic and Dr Ross's web accounts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.90,1:08:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,和罗博士的纲路帐号\N{\fnArial\fs30}and local PD have been placed on alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.30,1:08:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地警方设下临检站 只要他们出现就会通知我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll pop up somewhere and when they do, it comes straight to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.00,1:08:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会就这样出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not gonna just pop up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.10,1:08:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这五年来一直在各国游走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made it five years and got across borders without making any mistakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.20,1:09:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不会使用信用卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna use a damn credit card now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.40,1:09:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想逃早就走远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he was trying to escape, he'd be long gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.30,1:09:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次他不准备逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not trying to escape this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.50,1:09:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他想找人帮忙我们就能逮到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's looking for help and that's how we're gonna get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.10,1:09:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有和别人联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know what they're after and we know he's been talking to somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.60,1:09:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都看过资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all have copies of the correspondence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.90,1:09:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿先生和蓝先生的昵称\N{\fnArial\fs30}The aliases Mr Green and Mr Blue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.10,1:09:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经加入神盾资料库 标题：绿先生来信\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been added to the SHIELD Operations Database.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.20,1:09:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝先生 资料在这里 该见面了 绿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he comes up for air, we'll be waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.20,1:09:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一现身 我们马上知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he makes a peep, we'll hear him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.50,1:09:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一出错 我们就会出动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when he slips up, we'll be ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.80,1:09:30.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（神盾局）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.90,1:09:32.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（后勤部）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.60,1:09:41.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蓝先生 资料在这里）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.00,1:09:44.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（格邦学院）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.20,1:09:45.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（细胞生物系）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.70,1:09:46.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（山缪史登博士 找到符合项目）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.50,1:09:53.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（找到符合项目）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.60,1:09:59.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（山缪史登博士 纽约）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.10,1:10:00.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（格邦学院）
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.80,1:10:05.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（出售）
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.70,1:10:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.30,1:10:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么感觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.90,1:10:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,变身的感觉是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it happens, what do you experience?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.40,1:10:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我们在哈佛自愿参与的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember those experiments we volunteered for at Harvard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.10,1:10:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,引导幻觉实验吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those induced hallucinations?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.90,1:10:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那样 再放大一千倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lot like that, just a thousand times amplified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.20,1:10:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像把一公升迷幻药倒进我脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like someone's poured a litre of acid into my brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.20,1:10:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你记得什么吗？- 只有零星的画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you remember anything? - Only sporadic pictures.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.50,1:10:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多噪音 我什么也分不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too much noise. I can never derive anything out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.80,1:10:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么你还是在它里面 - 并没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But then it's still you inside it. - No. No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.80,1:11:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不晓得 但它在山洞 我觉得它就像知道我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. In the cave, I really felt like it knew me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.70,1:11:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你的大脑超载\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe your mind is in there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.20,1:11:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's just overcharged and can't process what's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.90,1:11:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想控制它 我想消灭它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to control it. I want to get rid of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.50,1:11:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.00,1:11:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才旗鼓相当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's even the playing field a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.20,1:11:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.40,1:11:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 醒醒 情况不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce, wake up. There's something going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.90,1:11:44.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（前有路障）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.50,1:11:46.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（准备停车）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.20,1:11:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得下车 慢慢往后面走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go. Walk toward the back. Just don't move too fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.70,1:12:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.10,1:12:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,到上城很远 坐地铁应该最快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a long way uptown. I think the subway's probably quickest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.30,1:12:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和几百个人挤在车厢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me in a metal tube, deep underground, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.40,1:12:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会被逼到抓狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}with hundreds of people in the most aggressive city in the world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.90,1:12:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 咱们坐计程车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Let's get a cab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.60,1:12:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！快点！你开车像个娘儿们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, now! Let's go! You're too slow! You drive like a woman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.80,1:12:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到没？一个大美女 - 哦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very nice. You see her? - Oh, my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.50,1:12:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有长眼睛呀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very pretty. Watch out, you goat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.70,1:12:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸 呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe, breathe, breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.00,1:12:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you out of your mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.80,1:13:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么？- 怎么了 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is wrong with you? - What's the matter, baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.20,1:13:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢飙车？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like a good ride?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.70,1:13:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,大混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.10,1:13:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以教你怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I know a few techniques could help you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.70,1:13:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 控制怒气 - 闭嘴 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- manage that anger very effectively. - You zip it. We're walking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.90,1:13:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 史登博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Dr Sterns?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.90,1:13:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 对不起打扰了 我是伊莉莎白罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - I'm sorry to bother you. I'm Elizabeth Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.40,1:13:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯博士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Dr Ross!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.50,1:13:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人想要见你 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have someone who'd like to meet you. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.90,1:13:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Mr Blue, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.20,1:13:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Green?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.80,1:13:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在猜你是不是真有其人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to tell you, I've been wondering if you were even real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.60,1:13:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是 你长什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you were, what would it look like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.40,1:13:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个蕴藏着这么强大力量的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A person with that much power lurking in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.20,1:13:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然像你这么不起眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing could have surprised me more{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.90,1:13:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我大吃一惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}than this unassuming man shaking my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.90,1:14:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不简单…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, look. We're not strolling into the park for a picnic, here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.60,1:14:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算一切都顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if everything goes perfectly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.40,1:14:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,引导你变身后注射正确剂量\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we induce an episode, if we get the dosage exactly right, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.20,1:14:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会永远被治愈…\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that going to be a lasting cure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.20,1:14:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,…或者只是暂时被压制而已？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or just some antidote to suppress that specific flare- up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.80,1:14:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.00,1:14:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是注射的剂量稍微多一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm saying is that if we overshoot this by even the smallest integer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.70,1:14:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会出现高成份的毒性\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're dealing with concentrations with extraordinary levels of toxicity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.70,1:14:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能会害死他 - 当然了 我敢肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean it could kill him. - Kill him? Yeah. I should say so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.90,1:14:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能完全相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should know that there's a flip side to this, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.10,1:14:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是剂量太少 无法压制我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we miss on the low side, if we induce me and it fails, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.80,1:14:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会陷入危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}this will be very dangerous for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.00,1:14:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向都是个好奇宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. I've always been more curious than cautious, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.20,1:14:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没出过事 到底要不要做呀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's served me pretty well. So, are we going to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.50,1:15:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么感觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feeling, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.80,1:15:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,像个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.30,1:16:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 躺上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. On the table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.80,1:16:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一你有强烈反应 这能保护你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}These will protect you from yourself if you have a strong reaction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.50,1:16:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你觉得太强烈再告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can tell me later if you thought it was strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.60,1:16:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 那些蠢研究生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on! Stupid graduate students.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.40,1:16:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, you, you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.50,1:16:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会是很新奇的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will be a somewhat novel sensation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.60,1:16:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.90,1:16:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,血液析离器会混和解药和你的血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dialysis machine will mix the antidote with your blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.10,1:17:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要完全变身解药才会起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except the antidote will only take hold once we've achieved a full reaction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.60,1:17:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.50,1:17:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 作业完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. We are comprehensive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.10,1:17:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.60,1:17:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. We set to pop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.10,1:17:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好别碰他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd take your hands off him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.00,1:17:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.20,1:18:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 还没结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait! There's more! Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.00,1:18:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在 现在！- 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now. Okay, now! - Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.70,1:18:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, do it! Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.80,1:18:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce! Bruce, look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.40,1:18:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快注射解药 史登 快呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me. The antidote, now! Sterns, do it now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.30,1:18:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 看着我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce, look at me. Look in my eyes. Please, look in my eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.40,1:18:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一定是开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you've got to be kidding me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.60,1:19:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.90,1:19:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.60,1:19:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯？你听得见吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce? Bruce, can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.70,1:19:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.70,1:19:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. You're okay. You're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.50,1:19:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撑过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.00,1:19:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fine. This is fantastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.80,1:19:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.90,1:20:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我这辈子见过最惊人的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the most extraordinary thing I have seen in my entire life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.00,1:20:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know what? Stop, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.60,1:20:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得讨论刚才发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to go back and talk about what just happened in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.10,1:20:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 伽玛脉冲来自大脑的杏仁核\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely. Okay. The gamma pulse came from the amygdala.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.00,1:20:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想是罗斯博士的核酸链 - 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think Dr Ross's primer…- Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.80,1:20:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,核酸链让你的细胞暂时吸收能量 过一阵子能量就减退\N{\fnArial\fs30}…lets the cells absorb the energy temporarily, and then it abates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.20,1:20:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你多年前才没死于辐射病\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you didn't die of radiation sickness years ago!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.00,1:20:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许中和了这些细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, maybe we've neutralised those cells permanently, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.80,1:20:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者只是压制这次变身\N{\fnArial\fs30}or maybe we just suppressed that event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.80,1:20:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是后者吧 但是我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm inclined to think the latter, but it's hard to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.20,1:20:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的实验样本从来没有存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}because none of our test subjects ever survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.10,1:20:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 他们没有得到核酸链 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course, they weren't getting the primer! - Wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.60,1:20:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 慢着，你说什么？- 它们没有吸收\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, what did you just say?- They weren't getting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.30,1:20:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 核酸链 - 不 不 实验样本？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the myostatin primer…- No, no, no. Test subjects?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.90,1:20:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么实验样本？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What test subjects?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.40,1:20:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.50,1:21:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布署得如何？- 狙击手负责A区\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the activity level? - Snipers are covering Alpha sector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.30,1:21:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先用白老鼠做实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}We started on rats and mice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.80,1:21:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是都死掉 于是得用大型动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it just completely fried them, so we had to go bigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.60,1:21:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定是伽玛或是你的血比较毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we still don't know which is more toxic, the gamma or your blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.80,1:21:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思？- 这全都是你的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean, my blood? - Bruce, this is all you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.40,1:21:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你寄给我的并不多 于是我浓缩以后又制造更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't send me much to work with, so I had to concentrate it and make more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.50,1:21:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要继续研究就有无限的可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a little more trial and error, there's no end to what we can do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.80,1:21:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,无穷的潜力\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is potentially Olympian!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.60,1:21:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种伽玛科技有数不尽的用途\N{\fnArial\fs30}This gamma technology has limitless applications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.20,1:21:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能发现数百种解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll unlock hundreds of cures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.40,1:21:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人类对各种疾病完全免疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will make humans impervious to disease!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.70,1:21:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们得销毁它\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, we've got to destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.80,1:21:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, what? - All of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.80,1:21:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚就得把这一切烧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight. We're gonna incinerate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.20,1:21:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里的所有？- 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this the whole supply? - What…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.60,1:21:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以得到诺贝尔奖耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could get the Nobel for this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.20,1:22:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道这东西的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand the power of this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.50,1:22:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,太危险了 无法控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is too dangerous. It cannot be controlled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.80,1:22:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到目标就开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}At your discretion, shooter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.40,1:22:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们三个！这是普罗米修斯的圣火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}three of us!This is Promethean fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.90,1:22:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.10,1:22:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄不准\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.60,1:22:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,布朗斯基进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blonsky's going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.60,1:22:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准进去 我女儿在里头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blonsky, stand down. My daughter's in there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.10,1:22:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the antidote now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.30,1:22:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只想把它当成武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't want the antidote! They want to make it a weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.00,1:22:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它被政府抢走就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we let it go, we will never get it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.20,1:22:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道它的力量有多强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know how powerful this thing is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.30,1:22:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也讨厌政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate the government just as much as anyone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.40,1:22:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你也未免太紧张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're being a little paranoid, don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.00,1:22:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯！布鲁斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce! Bruce!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.20,1:22:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.70,1:23:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it? Come on, where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.70,1:23:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show him to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.90,1:23:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,布朗斯基！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blonsky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.60,1:23:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.20,1:23:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,披着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.20,1:23:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢消灭浩克就得一辈子坐牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you took it from me, I'm gonna put you in a hole for the rest of your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.60,1:23:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.70,1:23:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会原谅你这么对他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never forgive what you've done to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.80,1:23:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个逃犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a fugitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.20,1:23:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你逼他成为逃犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made him a fugitive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.20,1:23:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了掩饰你的失败和保护你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}to cover your failures and to protect your career.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.50,1:23:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不屑再当你的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever speak to me as your daughter again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.60,1:23:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不是我女儿也会被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only because you're my daughter that you're not in handcuffs, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.00,1:24:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能打造出更多浩克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you telling me you can make more like him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.30,1:24:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不行 我有一些资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Not yet. I sorted out a few pieces, but it's not like I can put together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.20,1:24:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是还不能复制出同样的巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the same Humpty Dumpty, if that's what you're asking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.60,1:24:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,浩克纯粹是个意外 我的目标是要做得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a freak accident! The goal is to do it better!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.60,1:24:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳是唯一的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Banner's the only…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.30,1:24:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她真的很烦人 - 你为什么老是在打人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's an annoying bitch. - Why are you always hitting people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.10,1:24:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底是做了什么惹毛了你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what possibly could I have done to deserve such aggression?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.30,1:24:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你做的事 是你要做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what you've done. It's what you're gonna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.00,1:24:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你从班纳身上提炼的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want what you got out of Banner. I want that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.90,1:24:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你已经注射了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you've got a little something in you already, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.30,1:24:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要更多 你也看到他变成浩克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want more. You've seen what he becomes, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.60,1:24:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.80,1:24:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.20,1:24:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像神一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godlike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.60,1:25:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要变成那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I want that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.50,1:25:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把我变成那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need that. Make me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.50,1:25:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你体内有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you've got inside you already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.60,1:25:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,混在一起可能变成\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mix could be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.80,1:25:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个大祸害\N{\fnArial\fs30}an abomination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.00,1:25:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说我不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say I was unwilling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.40,1:25:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是需要你的同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need informed consent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.60,1:25:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've given it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.30,1:26:00.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（绿先生 效力14.56%）
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.50,1:26:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我想跟你解释的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I was trying to explain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.90,1:26:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你注射了什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you've been ladling into yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.90,1:26:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是很明显起了效用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But clearly it worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.10,1:26:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我假设你完全听不懂我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's assume you don't understand a word I'm saying, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.80,1:26:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过还是请你躺回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you'll just get back on the table, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.70,1:26:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我把你治好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can fix this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.10,1:26:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开枪！- 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shoot it! - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.60,1:26:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.30,1:27:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,D4呼叫队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delta 4 to Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.40,1:27:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀死我们两名弟兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took out two of our guys, two of our guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.20,1:27:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,布朗斯基和中校还在里头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blonsky and the Major are still inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.80,1:27:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Move, move, move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.10,1:27:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在那里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.50,1:27:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.70,1:27:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么东西？- 向它开枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that thing? - Shoot it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.40,1:27:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开车！快！快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right! You… You, drive! Let's go! Move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.30,1:27:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 队长 - 快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Delta 4 to Leader! - Go, go, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.70,1:27:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个大怪物从这里逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something big just went off down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.20,1:27:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 你最好听听看\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, you should hear this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.40,1:27:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,浩克在街上！重复 浩克在街上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hulk is in the street! I repeat, the Hulk is in the street!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.90,1:27:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 先冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible. You get a hold of yourself, young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.10,1:27:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get it together. What is your position?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.20,1:27:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,121街和北向百老汇路口\N{\fnArial\fs30}121st Street, heading north on Broadway!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.40,1:28:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快掉头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn us around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.00,1:28:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么要回去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going back. Why are we going back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.20,1:28:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! Give me eyes down there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.30,1:28:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.60,1:28:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.80,1:28:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.00,1:28:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.50,1:29:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的实验品吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.10,1:29:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.60,1:29:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire at him, fire at him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.70,1:29:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想它怕子弹吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think a rifle's gonna hurt that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.20,1:29:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.00,1:29:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,水喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.30,1:29:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快撤退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there, soldier!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.30,1:30:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我更强的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a real fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.30,1:30:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.10,1:30:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.80,1:30:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,下令把所有军力调到哈林区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them to bring everything they've got and head for Harlem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.20,1:30:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我去 你一定要让我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be me. You have to take me back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.90,1:30:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.70,1:30:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你能控制它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can control it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.00,1:30:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是控制 而是利用它\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, not control it, but, I don't know, maybe aim it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.20,1:30:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不行呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if you can't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.20,1:31:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西是我们创造出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.50,1:31:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.80,1:31:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.00,1:31:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 降落在它附近 - 不 留在高空\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Land us near it. - No, no. No, keep us high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.10,1:31:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开后舱门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the back door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.20,1:31:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 站住 你在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce! Bruce, stop! Stop! What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.20,1:31:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要想清楚 你不知道自己会不会变身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about this! You don't even know if you'll change!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.90,1:31:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么做 太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this! Please, this is insane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.20,1:31:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂 我得试一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betty, I've got to try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.10,1:31:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.70,1:32:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把她拉进来 - 来吧 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get her in here! - Come on, miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.00,1:32:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂 它在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. Betty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.10,1:32:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,浩克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hulk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.50,1:32:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.40,1:33:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.90,1:34:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有这点料吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all you've got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.60,1:34:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快用机关枪！帮助他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use that thing, soldier! Give him some help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.50,1:34:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮哪一个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.80,1:34:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色的那一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help the green one, damn it! Which one do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.20,1:34:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把另一个射死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the other one in half!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.70,1:34:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ross!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.70,1:35:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it on him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.60,1:35:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得紧急迫降 - 抓紧了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I got to put it down! - Hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.80,1:36:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.60,1:36:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？我来帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hurt? Let me help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.90,1:37:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 快想办法出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right. Just find a way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.60,1:37:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不配拥有这种力量 眼睁睁看她死吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't deserve this power! Now watch her die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.00,1:38:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.50,1:39:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军？\N{\fnArial\fs30}General?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.00,1:39:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有遗言吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any last words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.30,1:39:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,浩克出击！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hulk smash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.30,1:40:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.60,1:41:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.10,1:42:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.00,1:42:58.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（低电量）
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.70,1:43:14.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（贝拉库拉 加拿大卑诗省）
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.30,1:43:43.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（寄件人：米尔本当铺）
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.10,1:44:01.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（贝蒂罗斯 卡尔弗大学）
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.00,1:44:22.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（距离上次变身 第31天）
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.80,1:44:25.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（距离上次变身 第0天）
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.80,1:44:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reload.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.70,1:44:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reload.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.90,1:44:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走气啤酒和失败的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The smell of stale beer and defeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.20,1:44:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就告诉过你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I hate to say, "I told you so, " General, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.00,1:45:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级大兵计划被终止不是没原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that Super Soldier programme was put on ice for a reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.50,1:45:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向觉得硬体比较可靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always felt hardware was more reliable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.60,1:45:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史塔克 - 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stark. - General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.20,1:45:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是穿得光鲜亮丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always wear such nice suits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.70,1:45:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.90,1:45:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听说你有个不寻常的问题 - 你不用说我也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hear you have an unusual problem. - You should talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.70,1:45:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.90,1:45:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在组织一个联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I told you we were putting a team together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.50,1:45:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,“我们”是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's "we"?{\r}
